 zlib2 http://zlib.net/zlib-1.2.11.tar.gz zlib-1.2.11.zip\r\n> -- Downloading http://zlib.net/zlib-1.2.11.tar.gz...\r\n> -- Generated portfile: /home/sweemer/test/vcpkg\\ports\\zlib2\\portfile.cmake\r\n> -- Generated CONTROL: /home/sweemer/test/vcpkg\\ports\\zlib2\\CONTROL\r\n> -- To launch an editor for these new files, run\r\n> --     .\\vcpkg edit zlib2\r\n\r\n**Failure logs** \r\n> $ ./vcpkg create zlib2 http://zlib.net/zlib-1.2.11.tar.gz zlib-1.2.11.zip\r\n> CMake Error at scripts/ports.cmake:14 (message):\r\n>           Your vcpkg executable is outdated and is not compatible with the current CMake scripts.\r\n>           Please re-build vcpkg by running bootstrap-vcpkg.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nThis was working fine as of revision `01926a1eb1117052964959ef0d334812021a23fe` last week.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BillyONeal","id":1544943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQ5NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal","html_url":"https://github.com/BillyONeal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/11784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github